{"schema":1,"docId":"constitution","locale":"zh","contentVersion":"legal-lab-2026-10-15.2","id":0,"start":0,"units":[{"id":"constitution-u0a2befdebb4c29a7bc-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"于1993年12月12日经全民投票通过","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “于1993年12月12日经全民投票通过”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0ec370686bc2b7b448-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"含全俄罗斯投票批准的修正","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “含全俄罗斯投票批准的修正”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-udb7f248a77d1d90837-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"2020年7月1日","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “2020年7月1日”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u66a23905e7b519a89b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"俄罗斯联邦宪法","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “俄罗斯联邦宪法”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ueb1a5f90f357c9f71a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"我们，俄罗斯联邦多民族人民，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “我们，俄罗斯联邦多民族人民，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud8542b10e577738f13-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"在自己的土地上由共同命运联结在一起，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “在自己的土地上由共同命运联结在一起，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uaac7baa1f7bf7eb614-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"确立人的权利与自由、公民和平与和睦，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “确立人的权利与自由、公民和平与和睦，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub16448d57f7371d009-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"维护历史形成的国家统一，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “维护历史形成的国家统一，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u68184a4fc69c2250d1-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"遵循公认的各民族平等与自决原则，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “遵循公认的各民族平等与自决原则，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue22fd7e3edcd92006f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"缅怀向我们传承对祖国的热爱与尊重、对善良与正义的信念的先辈，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “缅怀向我们传承对祖国的热爱与尊重、对善良与正义的信念的先辈，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ude4f7080ef725835bc-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"复兴俄罗斯的主权国家地位，确立其民主基础的不可动摇性，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “复兴俄罗斯的主权国家地位，确立其民主基础的不可动摇性，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u55baf860885b3cb247-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"力求保障俄罗斯的福祉与繁荣，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “力求保障俄罗斯的福祉与繁荣，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u452f4e319962fb3461-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"基于对当代和后代承担的祖国责任，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “基于对当代和后代承担的祖国责任，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uc8899d107e9f79d919-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"认识到我们是国际社会的一部分，","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “认识到我们是国际社会的一部分，”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6705dd206da3c424e1-1","sectionId":"constitution-s1","locator":"文件开头","text":"通过《俄罗斯联邦宪法》。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/","label":"文件开头 · “通过《俄罗斯联邦宪法》。”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0e87e7508a3b24f5bb-1","sectionId":"constitution-s2","locator":"第I部分","text":"第I部分","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17166d7c66fc717bc3ec300f18fb0f71ba16a9be/","label":"第I部分","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u87e3201c6af5364422-1","sectionId":"constitution-s3","locator":"第一部分","text":"第一部分","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17166d7c66fc717bc3ec300f18fb0f71ba16a9be/","label":"第一部分","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u55c6e071830b20b21e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s4","locator":"第1章 宪法制度基础","text":"第1章 宪法制度基础","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/3c4f68c49c14f831a19e87211b9fffe8a06e549f/","label":"第1章 宪法制度基础","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u81b5114ab4a156956d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s5","locator":"第1条","text":"第1条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b57f514e606ee66a6f97d072551b16a416610dfc/","label":"第1条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u4498ed5e420844b039-1","sectionId":"constitution-s5","locator":"第1条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦——俄罗斯是实行共和政体的民主联邦法治国家。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b57f514e606ee66a6f97d072551b16a416610dfc/","label":"第1款 第1条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u8860c11cfe4883ecdb-1","sectionId":"constitution-s5","locator":"第1条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦和俄罗斯两个名称具有同等含义。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b57f514e606ee66a6f97d072551b16a416610dfc/","label":"第2款 第1条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ude0dd1818c3e4bba0c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s6","locator":"第2条","text":"第2条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec8354bcf00aac2d2899fbf033c3ef963e91411e/","label":"第2条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u72ee2197858cb795cd-1","sectionId":"constitution-s6","locator":"第2条","text":"人及其权利与自由是最高价值。承认、遵守和保护人和公民的权利与自由，是国家的义务。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec8354bcf00aac2d2899fbf033c3ef963e91411e/","label":"第2条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u77f3a3e92b4ce1b614-1","sectionId":"constitution-s7","locator":"第3条","text":"第3条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/249eba46b69e162f87771713b6e37fb0780f2c40/","label":"第3条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u780814442349094e86-1","sectionId":"constitution-s7","locator":"第3条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦主权的承载者和权力的唯一来源是其多民族人民。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/249eba46b69e162f87771713b6e37fb0780f2c40/","label":"第1款 第3条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud5ee189bbc46d6d3a5-1","sectionId":"constitution-s7","locator":"第3条","text":"2. 人民直接行使权力，也通过国家权力机关和地方自治机关行使权力。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/249eba46b69e162f87771713b6e37fb0780f2c40/","label":"第2款 第3条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0d1115748938afffb4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s7","locator":"第3条","text":"3. 全民公决和自由选举是人民权力的最高直接体现。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/249eba46b69e162f87771713b6e37fb0780f2c40/","label":"第3款 第3条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-udaad3e7637f7ec3413-1","sectionId":"constitution-s7","locator":"第3条","text":"4. 任何人不得在俄罗斯联邦篡夺权力。夺取权力或侵占权力职权的行为，依联邦法律予以追究。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/249eba46b69e162f87771713b6e37fb0780f2c40/","label":"第4款 第3条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud93823e955716f2dc8-1","sectionId":"constitution-s8","locator":"第4条","text":"第4条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2c0a0829d49e2cd602772f82339934e740359951/","label":"第4条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-udff000befbdabc4813-1","sectionId":"constitution-s8","locator":"第4条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦的主权及于其全部领土。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2c0a0829d49e2cd602772f82339934e740359951/","label":"第1款 第4条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ueeb0c593303e2462ca-1","sectionId":"constitution-s8","locator":"第4条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦宪法和联邦法律在俄罗斯联邦全境具有最高效力。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2c0a0829d49e2cd602772f82339934e740359951/","label":"第2款 第4条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u80d8b30d4ad2484aa8-1","sectionId":"constitution-s8","locator":"第4条","text":"3. 俄罗斯联邦保障其领土的完整和不可侵犯。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2c0a0829d49e2cd602772f82339934e740359951/","label":"第3款 第4条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ubb7171be794b836e2e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s9","locator":"第5条","text":"第5条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8f4aa3d43fcd8ccf6cfbf4843536a14ae6f758f2/","label":"第5条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud6b6d2144d8dadc7bc-1","sectionId":"constitution-s9","locator":"第5条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦由共和国、边疆区、州、联邦直辖市、自治州和自治专区组成；它们是俄罗斯联邦地位平等的主体。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8f4aa3d43fcd8ccf6cfbf4843536a14ae6f758f2/","label":"第1款 第5条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6639825412ef2c0c49-1","sectionId":"constitution-s9","locator":"第5条","text":"2. 共和国（国家）有自己的宪法和法律体系。边疆区、州、联邦直辖市、自治州、自治专区有自己的章程和法律体系。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8f4aa3d43fcd8ccf6cfbf4843536a14ae6f758f2/","label":"第2款 第5条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uda3054f17569bcb707-1","sectionId":"constitution-s9","locator":"第5条","text":"3. 俄罗斯联邦的联邦结构，以国家完整、国家权力体系统一、俄罗斯联邦国家权力机关与俄罗斯联邦主体国家权力机关之间管辖事项和职权的划分，以及俄罗斯联邦各民族的平等和自决为基础。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8f4aa3d43fcd8ccf6cfbf4843536a14ae6f758f2/","label":"第3款 第5条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue07e5ad1b860ca573c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s9","locator":"第5条","text":"4. 在与联邦国家权力机关的关系中，俄罗斯联邦所有主体彼此地位平等。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8f4aa3d43fcd8ccf6cfbf4843536a14ae6f758f2/","label":"第4款 第5条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-udd035c15f049dbaead-1","sectionId":"constitution-s10","locator":"第6条","text":"第6条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec4505d0691b04f300ee90b8015e4932487fe116/","label":"第6条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u2ab80a531756159aa6-1","sectionId":"constitution-s10","locator":"第6条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦国籍依联邦法律取得和终止，无论取得依据如何，国籍均为统一且平等。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec4505d0691b04f300ee90b8015e4932487fe116/","label":"第1款 第6条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u713c174a4588751d08-1","sectionId":"constitution-s10","locator":"第6条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦每一公民在其境内享有俄罗斯联邦宪法规定的一切权利与自由，并承担平等义务。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec4505d0691b04f300ee90b8015e4932487fe116/","label":"第2款 第6条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u25e643351bf1b34530-1","sectionId":"constitution-s10","locator":"第6条","text":"3. 不得剥夺俄罗斯联邦公民的国籍或其改变国籍的权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec4505d0691b04f300ee90b8015e4932487fe116/","label":"第3款 第6条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u688e56d1b5bafa0176-1","sectionId":"constitution-s11","locator":"第7条","text":"第7条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/6e9322b9a111e965ab5650f7f01bf0039d6a29c6/","label":"第7条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u8b864da064f7c8ad2f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s11","locator":"第7条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦是社会国家，其政策旨在创造保障人有尊严的生活和自由发展的条件。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/6e9322b9a111e965ab5650f7f01bf0039d6a29c6/","label":"第1款 第7条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u5f9d36c8bbd9c39b5d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s11","locator":"第7条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦保护人们的劳动和健康，规定有保障的最低工资，保障国家对家庭、母亲、父亲和儿童、残疾人及老年公民的支持，发展社会服务体系，设立国家养老金、补助及其他社会保障措施。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/6e9322b9a111e965ab5650f7f01bf0039d6a29c6/","label":"第2款 第7条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud7412059c5138d9352-1","sectionId":"constitution-s12","locator":"第8条","text":"第8条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c07038c724cae52fe849aad193a0eac08bda5f93/","label":"第8条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u8df179959df85494d0-1","sectionId":"constitution-s12","locator":"第8条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦保障经济空间统一、商品、服务和资金自由流动，保障对竞争的支持和经济活动自由。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c07038c724cae52fe849aad193a0eac08bda5f93/","label":"第1款 第8条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u856fa1a0886ce353c4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s12","locator":"第8条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦平等承认和保护私人、国家、市政及其他所有制形式。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c07038c724cae52fe849aad193a0eac08bda5f93/","label":"第2款 第8条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0f41a17bd2f8838ffa-1","sectionId":"constitution-s13","locator":"第9条","text":"第9条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1efbc1b5ebdab46ae63fe9219156c319914287b3/","label":"第9条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u1e7219757b09db998f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s13","locator":"第9条","text":"1. 土地和其他自然资源在俄罗斯联邦作为居住在相应地域的各族人民生活与活动的基础而被利用和保护。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1efbc1b5ebdab46ae63fe9219156c319914287b3/","label":"第1款 第9条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ufabbc6cc28d760f1b6-1","sectionId":"constitution-s13","locator":"第9条","text":"2. 土地和其他自然资源可以采取私人、国家、市政及其他所有制形式。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1efbc1b5ebdab46ae63fe9219156c319914287b3/","label":"第2款 第9条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uef487aaa43bb47e948-1","sectionId":"constitution-s14","locator":"第10条","text":"第10条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5fc039bb7454f1af7eba9238d9b35574d81dd447/","label":"第10条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u9a351be5af65a89019-1","sectionId":"constitution-s14","locator":"第10条","text":"俄罗斯联邦的国家权力以立法、行政和司法分立为基础行使。立法机关、行政机关和司法机关各自独立。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5fc039bb7454f1af7eba9238d9b35574d81dd447/","label":"第10条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0a2df1e4497066ba76-1","sectionId":"constitution-s15","locator":"第11条","text":"第11条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4ca74822d433c87199b0856a366fcb40227624e3/","label":"第11条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud860b7745a34c305d7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s15","locator":"第11条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦的国家权力由俄罗斯联邦总统、联邦会议（联邦委员会和国家杜马）、俄罗斯联邦政府和俄罗斯联邦法院行使。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4ca74822d433c87199b0856a366fcb40227624e3/","label":"第1款 第11条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-udfa0fb4c21c8df4ad2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s15","locator":"第11条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦各主体的国家权力由其设立的国家权力机关行使。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4ca74822d433c87199b0856a366fcb40227624e3/","label":"第2款 第11条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u5c7223678aa4970937-1","sectionId":"constitution-s15","locator":"第11条","text":"3. 俄罗斯联邦国家权力机关与俄罗斯联邦主体国家权力机关之间的管辖事项和职权，由本宪法、联邦条约及其他关于划分管辖事项和职权的条约划定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4ca74822d433c87199b0856a366fcb40227624e3/","label":"第3款 第11条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue863848005ed56626f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s16","locator":"第12条","text":"第12条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec531d2938f351bcb3a9b2f1b50a6f119eac231a/","label":"第12条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud397de86ede882bb8d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s16","locator":"第12条","text":"俄罗斯联邦承认并保障地方自治。地方自治在其职权范围内独立进行。地方自治机关不属于国家权力机关体系。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ec531d2938f351bcb3a9b2f1b50a6f119eac231a/","label":"第12条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u07330865c70dd727fa-1","sectionId":"constitution-s17","locator":"第13条","text":"第13条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5b9338a7944b7701fbe63f48c943e8175be16462/","label":"第13条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u51f5c47d1c1020d2b2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s17","locator":"第13条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦承认意识形态多样性。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5b9338a7944b7701fbe63f48c943e8175be16462/","label":"第1款 第13条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud3f11856c4dace79fd-1","sectionId":"constitution-s17","locator":"第13条","text":"2. 任何意识形态均不得被确立为国家的或强制性的意识形态。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5b9338a7944b7701fbe63f48c943e8175be16462/","label":"第2款 第13条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud8e1aabfc6d19e6cc9-1","sectionId":"constitution-s17","locator":"第13条","text":"3. 俄罗斯联邦承认政治多样性和多党制。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5b9338a7944b7701fbe63f48c943e8175be16462/","label":"第3款 第13条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u435289becfc2202b13-1","sectionId":"constitution-s17","locator":"第13条","text":"4. 社会团体在法律面前一律平等。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5b9338a7944b7701fbe63f48c943e8175be16462/","label":"第4款 第13条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uefaaacb9497247be6d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s17","locator":"第13条","text":"5. 禁止建立以暴力改变宪法制度基础、破坏俄罗斯联邦完整、危害国家安全、组建武装组织或煽动社会、种族、民族和宗教纷争为目的或实施上述行为的社会团体，并禁止其活动。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5b9338a7944b7701fbe63f48c943e8175be16462/","label":"第5款 第13条","heading":false}]}
